cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below, and also cite the original paper and mumax3."
title: "PicoSOT: mumax3 replica of picosecond spin-orbit torque switching"
abstract: "mumax3 replica of spin-orbit torque switching of a perpendicular ferromagnet with 6 ps electrical pulses (Jhuria et al., Nature Electronics 3, 680-686, 2020). Includes a time-exact LLG model, a phenomenological Joule-heating model, phase diagrams, symmetry and mechanism controls, and figure-ready plots."
type: software
